{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"承接S02-2中接下这一步后重新获得力量的事实，也解释了他为什么仍愿坚持，没有新增具体往事或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"亲近带来的温暖及坚定可能只是努力想成为的样子，都能在B1中找到依据，没有把比喻写成真实发生的动作或具体关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"追问当时还有什么可能对应B4的反复自问，过去无法原样回来也对应B1、B2，没有新增具体对白或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"眼前责任在S03-3中已有依据，行动无法安顿失落也是心理判断，没有把被时间追赶的比喻写成真实的外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"前条对先前昂扬的怀疑能引出重新审视那一步，但没有直接提供那一步确实让他重新行动起来的事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前条明确说接下这一步后有了力量，也发现不必等疑虑消失才能行动，直接解释了他为何仍愿坚持。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前条明确写出亲近带来的松弛与珍贵感，足以解释他不愿否认那份温暖，坚定的另一面则由B1补足。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前条明确说他仍惦记从前的亲近且如今不能自然拥有，直接支撑这份温暖至今仍影响着他。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他因先前的行动确实有效而愿意坚持，因仍珍惜那份亲近而反复追问，又因现实责任与未解失落并存而无法安顿下来。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R15\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"没有明确保留‘眼下仍有缺口，不等于先前一切都错’这一判断；‘舍不得否认那种亲近带来的温暖’保留了对温暖的留恋，却把先前轻快确实存在、当下的失落不能推翻先前经历这一层意思弱化成了不舍。\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S04-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"分号把亲近带来的温暖与坚定可能只是理想自我这两个不同的心理判断并列在一条里，虽然都对应B1，但条目承担的内容偏多。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S04-4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"‘行动能让他重新动起来’重复S04-1，‘眼前的事催着他往前’又复述S03-1、S03-3的责任压力，而‘不能安顿失落’与S04-3的过去无法带回相近，一条里叠了多层意思。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4d5b345c-8b16-417f-b88d-7e99ddc5146d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T095907447134Z", "elapsed_seconds": 448.735, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:06:36.178931+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5801e6ab9bb76e45609271e5d4f36d29290847b98610369d39d928f6d1a688fe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T095907447134Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bc3578067730d58cf43a8ef7c02cf8ed956c91bdfcbfe0c3efee246cf6f6c75f"}}}
